---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base>
  <h1>Andrew Pope</h1>
  <p class="muted">
    Air Force officer. Building toward the intersection of trusted silicon and
    on-device AI.
  </p>

  <p>
    I document hard things while I'm learning them — the artifacts are the
    byproduct. Right now that means a ground-up course on how modern chips work
    (logic gates up through GPUs and AI accelerators), some on-device inference
    work, and a tinywhoop flight-controller board built around the STM32G473.
  </p>

  <p>
    I'd rather show the work than claim authority. This is where it lives.
  </p>

  <h2>Currently</h2>
  <ul class="entry-list">
    <li>
      <span class="entry-title">Circuit Box</span>
      <span class="badge">building</span>
      <p class="entry-desc">
        An interactive logic-circuit builder that walks the full ladder of
        abstraction — from a single gate up to a working 8-bit CPU.
      </p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="entry-title">Chip course</span>
      <p class="entry-desc">
        Working through how computers are built from physics up, anchored to
        real hardware.
      </p>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <p style="margin-top:2rem;">
    <a href="/work">Work</a> · <a href="/writing">Writing</a> ·
    <a href="/apps">Apps</a>
  </p>
</Base>
